<title>USA: Costa Rica seeks 26,500 T optional rice - trade.</title>
<headline>Costa Rica seeks 26,500 T optional rice - trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Costa Rica will be tendering on April 30 for 26,500 tonnes optional origin long grain rough rice or 18,000 tonnes long grain milled rice, U.S. number 3 or equivalent, maximum 15 percent broken, exporters and traders said.</p>
<p>The rice was slated for June 30-July 7 arrival, one exporter said.</p>
<p>One exporter said offers have to be in by April 16 rather than April 30.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
